'''Madam Azumarill''' (Japanese: '''マスター マリルリ''' ''Master Marilli'') is a Pokémon who appeared in [[Magical Pokémon Journey]]. She is [[Apricot]]'s and [[Marimaru]]'s teacher in the ninja arts and is even more talented than [[Master Ditto]] is in the ninja arts. She is [[Marimaru]]'s mother.
